Package: qcom-adreno1
Architecture: arm64
Description: Qualcomm Adreno User Mode (metapackage)
 Collection of prebuilt User Mode libraries to support OpenGL ES, Vulkan, and
 OpenCL APIs for Qualcomm Adreno GPUs.
 .
 This package depends on libraries required to support all runtime features.
